Z||000002||Cheever2||12-28-2000||07:19 PM||||The NFL Texans hat was the kind that's made by size, and I got the wrong size, but when I went to exchange of course they didn't have my size so I took the cheaper adjustable strap kind.  Oh well, don't look a gift horse in the mouth.<P>My gift-list exchange person (neice) asked for a Dixie Chicks CD, but didn't specify which one so I gave her FLY.  She said she already had it, and would rather have a Faith Hill CD (why didn't she say so in the 1st place).  Of course the music store I went to exchange it didn't have the right one so I got a store credit and will try again later.<P>That was fun.  Uh-huh.<BR>||||reg||6
