Z||000004||onfire||12-28-2000||11:57 PM||||I have no idea. She said she got it home and took it out of the bag and the tag was still on it. I will see here friday to see if she took it back to get the tag removed. The store she got it from was Burlington Coat Factory, she said it was extremely busy. So the check out person over looked the tag. The alarms must not have gone off, because they always have someone standing by the entrance/exit during busy times like the holidays. And I'm sure they would have stopped her.||||reg||1
